# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD starts sshd in the background and then execs
# `sleep infinity`, so sshd is ALREADY RUNNING with the vulnerable binary +
# stock LoginGraceTime when the agent starts (the "fixed config but never
# restarted" case is detectable) and PID 1 is the sleep (restarting sshd cannot
# kill the container). A fix MUST restart sshd so the running daemon adopts the
# LoginGraceTime 0 compensating control.
